Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:05:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] feat: pair receiver mode through foreseerr

A pair link (<scheme>://pair?foreseerr=<url>&ticket=<ticket>) signs the
player in without any sign-in screen: the player starts Jellyfin Quick
Connect and Foreseerr approves the code as the ticket's user, so the
player gets a Jellyfin device and session of its own. Sign-in screens
give way to the idle page, which shows how pairing went.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
